{
  "id": "p41",
  "title": "The Marathon Ledger",
  "titleZh": "马拉松账目",
  "topic": "公益马拉松与捐款欺诈",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My professor leads a charity project in a poor region.",
        "zh": "我的教授在一个贫困地区主持一个慈善项目。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A public agency provides a modest income and a small quiet office.",
        "zh": "一家公共机构提供一份不多的经费和一间小办公室。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We intend to hold a running event and raise a fortune.",
        "zh": "我们打算办一场跑步活动，筹一大笔钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A brilliant assistant designs the route and the safety gear.",
        "zh": "一位出色的助手设计路线和安全装备。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Local shops offer a discount, and nearby farms donate food.",
        "zh": "本地商店给出折扣，附近农场捐来食物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then an elderly teacher joins as an amateur runner.",
        "zh": "接着一位年长的教师作为业余跑者加入。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A thousand runners participate in the league tournament.",
        "zh": "上千名跑者参加这场联赛锦标赛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The motor pool lends a van, and the cooks fry eggs for all.",
        "zh": "车队借来一辆货车，厨师们为大家煎鸡蛋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sudden bomb threat causes real panic near the finish line.",
        "zh": "一个突如其来的炸弹威胁在终点线附近引起恐慌。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The police execute a search and lower the yellow curtain.",
        "zh": "警察执行搜查，并放下黄色的帷幕。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A relative of mine helps the children walk to a safe shed.",
        "zh": "我的一位亲戚帮孩子们走到安全的棚屋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We appreciate every volunteer and assist the virtually exhausted crowd.",
        "zh": "我们感激每位志愿者，也帮助几乎筋疲力尽的人群。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An analyst samples the accounts and finds a strange component.",
        "zh": "一位分析师抽样核对账目，发现一个奇怪的组成部分。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A shell company took a billion in donations, including ours.",
        "zh": "一家空壳公司拿走了十亿捐款，包括我们的那笔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The scholar is beaten by criticism, but she will not deny it.",
        "zh": "这位学者被批评压得抬不起头，但她不会否认。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A protest grows, and the exposure threatens the whole plan.",
        "zh": "抗议在扩大，曝光威胁着整个计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She has sufficient proof and a clear understanding of the fraud.",
        "zh": "她有足够的证据，也清楚这场欺诈的来龙去脉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The board presumably recommends a full audit and a report.",
        "zh": "董事会想必会建议进行一次全面审计并出具报告。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My assistant finds a thirteenth invoice from the same firm.",
        "zh": "我的助手发现了同一家公司开出的第十三张发票。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My file names a convict who had a share of the fortune.",
        "zh": "我的档案里点出一个分到这笔钱的罪犯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the court hears the case, and justice is slow but still effective.",
        "zh": "接着法庭审理此案，正义虽慢却有效。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The conviction ends the scam, and the shell firm is closed.",
        "zh": "一项定罪终结了这场骗局，那家空壳公司也被关闭。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A whip of wind shakes the curtain, and the race goes on.",
        "zh": "一阵风抽动帷幕，比赛继续进行。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The principal praises the tired young runners, and the medal shines.",
        "zh": "校长称赞疲惫的跑者，奖牌闪闪发亮。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later the publishing team prints the accounts and the income returns.",
        "zh": "后来出版团队印出账目，收入也回来了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A revolution in local giving reveals the potential of small donors.",
        "zh": "本地捐赠的一场变革显出小额捐助者的潜力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We contribute a sample of the new plan to the board.",
        "zh": "我们把新方案的一份样本交给董事会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The staff celebrate, and the region remembers the long marathon.",
        "zh": "员工们庆祝，这个地区也记住了这场漫长的马拉松。"
      }
    ]
  ],
